# Local Bug Investigator

Use the local Ollama + SQLite RAG agent (not Cursor Cloud) to investigate bugs from symptoms/stacktraces:

```bash
./scripts/pr-review-index.sh   # shared RAG index (with PR reviewer)
./scripts/bug-investigate.sh --bug "Confirm booking does nothing"
./scripts/bug-investigate.sh --stacktrace crash.txt
./scripts/bug-investigate.sh --bug "..." --pr 42
```

Rules: `agents/bug-investigator/RULES.md`.
Index: `agents/pr-reviewer/index/rag.sqlite` (shared).

Focus on root-cause analysis along UI → Bloc → Service → Api:

- Ignored `ResponseEntity.exception`
- Fire-and-forget async loads in blocs
- Missing error/loading UI branches
- Null bangs / setState after dispose
- Stacktrace frames as primary leads

Prefer evidence-bound hypotheses and a concrete recommended fix — never auto-patch or merge.
